        "overview": "<p>One week, two OpenStack events:</p>\n<ol><li><strong>For active OpenStack developers</strong>: gather to plan the next release at the <strong>Design Summit, April 16-18</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>For Everyone:</strong> attend the <strong>OpenStack Conference, April 19 &amp; 20</strong>. The conference will have speakers, panels, and sessions of interest our\u00a0entire community of\u00a0\u00a0users, vendors, CIOs, researchers, and developers.</li>\n</ol>",
