      "landing": {
        "overview": "<h1>Summit Videos Are Now Online</h1>\n<p>Thank you for attending the OpenStack Summit this October in San Diego. Even if you couldn't make it, you'll be interested in the extensive collection of <a href=\"/summit/san-diego-2012/openstack-summit-sessions/\">recorded videos</a> now available online.</p>\n<p><a class=\"roundedButton\" href=\"/summit/san-diego-2012/openstack-summit-sessions/\">Summit Videos</a></p>",
        "sidebar": "<h2>The Dates</h2>\n<ul id=\"detail-summary\"><li><strong>OpenStack Summit</strong>: October 15-18</li>\n</ul><h2>The Location</h2>\n<p><a href=\"http://bit.ly/sandiegohyatt\">San Diego Manchester Grand Hyatt </a><br/> San Diego, California</p>\n<p class=\"sidebar-note\">Special Note: The OpenStack room rate is now sold out at the Grand Hyatt. <span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\">We've set up another room block at the Embassy Suites located across the street. <a href=\"http://embassysuites.hilton.com/en/es/groups/personalized/S/SANDNES-OPE-20121014/index.jhtml?WT.mc_id=POG\">Reserve a room</a> at the OpenStack rate</span> (SOLD OUT). \u00a0Last chance, try the <a href=\"https://gc.synxis.com/rez.aspx?Hotel=56669&amp;Chain=13924&amp;arrive=10/14/2012&amp;depart=10/19/2012&amp;adult=1&amp;child=0&amp;group=1210OPENST\">Hard Rock Hotel</a>\u00a0which is fairly close.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://bit.ly/sandiegohyatt\"><img src=\"/themes/openstack/images/conferences/manchester-photo.jpg\" width=\"193\" height=\"192\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?hl=en&amp;q=Manchester+Grand+Hyatt&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;hq=&amp;hnear=1+Market+Pl,+San+Diego,+California+92101&amp;gl=us&amp;ll=32.71232,-117.16817&amp;spn=0.011808,0.022724&amp;t=v&amp;z=16&amp;vpsrc=0&amp;iwloc=A&amp;cid=1601215160763563167\"><img src=\"/themes/openstack/images/conferences/sd-google-map.gif\" width=\"193\" height=\"192\"/></a></p>",
